{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q418469","formula":"C₂₇H₃₂O₁₄","hill":"C27H32O14","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":27.0,"H":32.0,"O":14.0},"names":{"en":"Naringin","uk":"Нарингін"},"descriptions":{"en":"Naringin is a flavanone-7-O-glycoside between the flavanone naringenin and the disaccharide neohesperidose. The flavonoid naringin occurs naturally in citrus fruits, especially in grapefruit, where naringin is responsible for the fruit's bitter taste. In commercial grapefruit juice production, the enzyme naringinase can be used to remove the bitterness (debittering) created by naringin.","uk":"Нарингін — глікозильований флавоноїд, (флавоїдний глікозид). Це один з основних флавоноїдів в грейпфрутах, який надає соку грейпфрута його гіркий смак. Нарингін, поряд із рутином і рамнозою індукують синтез α-L-рамнозидази (КФ 3.2.1.40) у Aspergillus terreus — грибка (цвіль), який широко використовується в промисловості для виробництва важливих органічних кислот."},"fame":18,"pubchemCid":442428,"mass":580.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H]1[C@@H]([C@H]([C@H]([C@@H](O1)O[C@@H]2[C@H]([C@@H]([C@H](O[C@H]2OC3=CC(=C4C(=O)C[C@H](OC4=C3)C5=CC=C(C=C5)O)O)CO)O)O)O)O)O","inchikey":"DFPMSGMNTNDNHN-ZPHOTFPESA-N","iupac":"(2S)-7-[(2S,3R,4S,5S,6R)-4,5-dihydroxy-6-(hydroxymethyl)-3-[(2S,3R,4R,5R,6S)-3,4,5-trihydroxy-6-methyloxan-2-yl]oxyoxan-2-yl]oxy-5-hydroxy-2-(4-hydroxyphenyl)-2,3-dihydrochromen-4-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"442428","atoms":73,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.462,"y":-0.283,"z":0.739,"el":"O"},{"x":1.309,"y":2.607,"z":0.135,"el":"O"},{"x":4.793,"y":-1.004,"z":-1.089,"el":"O"},{"x":1.361,"y":0.549,"z":-0.965,"el":"O"},{"x":5.045,"y":1.998,"z":1.726,"el":"O"},{"x":3.314,"y":4.019,"z":2.854,"el":"O"},{"x":6.721,"y":-1.885,"z":0.853,"el":"O"},{"x"